### Plan review

| Need | Skill / tool | Limited use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Plan depth, dependencies, rollback, observable done-checks | `plan` skill | Risk/depth and done-check rubric only. Not persistence or outcome logging. |
| Assumptions and material failure modes | `analyze` skill | `Pre-mortem` and `Steel man`. Separate blockers from optional improvements. |
| A large Markdown plan | `treemd` skill | Non-interactive `--tree`, `-l`, `--at-line`, or `-s`. Not the TUI. |
